{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はある撮影でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"再来月発売のあの雑誌！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も可愛く個性的に\n撮ってもらえました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりかわいい世界観！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オシャレしたくなる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オシャレしてどこかいきたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊びに行きたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/02/1473793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/02/1473793/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱちっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/02/1473793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね、スタッフさんとかと話してて\nあー、将来人付き合い下手くそそうだな～ひなこ～\nって思った( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お隣さんとかご近所さんで\n仲良しの方とかいるけど\nわたしはきっと挨拶だけする関係なんだろうな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にカフェ行って話したり\n夜ご飯を一緒に作って\nどっちかの家で食べたり\nそーゆうシーンドラマとかで見るけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子はできなさそう～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、チップときみとしろみと\nのーーんびりゆーーーったり過ごす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもきっと、ままがチップもしろみもきみも\n日奈子に渡してくれないだろうから\n実家から離れないんだろうな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それならそれでいいか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の未来を想像するのが\nたのしい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事とかじゃなくて\nプライベートの将来のはなし！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってさ、こんなこと言っておいて\nいい感じにお友達多いかもしれないじゃん？(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うしししし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しの友達の\nつぐれなとは大人になっても\n仲良しでいたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、きっと、仲良しであろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/02/1473793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/02/1473793/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、ずーっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねむむむむむむ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/02/1473793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お日様のでてるポカポカする日に\nおやすみがあったとしたら\n何しようかな～って考えるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこかの川で、魚釣りしたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のーびりと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近時間が進むのがすごく早く感じるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、魚釣りとか\nそーゆうことしてたら\n時間をゆっくり感じられるかもしれない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまみぐい！\n昔から、つまみぐいだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急に金木犀の香りが\n恋しくなってきた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影で今年は1回しか感じられなかった！"}],"source":"archive"}